{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n こんにちは！\n 松平璃子です🐰🤍\n \n \n \n はっぴーはろうぃん🎃\n \n \n \n 猫になったよ〜😖\n お気に入りの今年の冬パジャマ🐈\n かわいくてとってもお気に入りです😖💓\n \n \n \n \n にゃん☁️\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDHSH6C4EZWHAMNXBAPKE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDJXDX1XE0EZEWD5HPCF5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDKYX8CCED9QHWHFK8KNH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDN1B32Y8X17H6X4MMM5T","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n すやすや☁️☁️\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDP3CQ57CPPQHSV3H49AK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 猫ちゃんがたくさんいます💓\n \n \n \n \n \n 部屋着がテーマなので\n ナチュラルなメイクにしました🐈\n ピンクブラウンのアイシャドウが自分には一番\n 合うな😖💓\n 髪の毛はお団子だよ〜\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDQ4CTJ4EK7N841N2Q5DK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDR5MDW77B70AVZMTASQ3","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 今日の音楽\n UVERworld / ハルジオン\n 歌詞に励まされます！\n \n \n あと、King Gnuさんの新曲聴きました！\n 「三文小説」とっても儚いなって思いました😖\n バラードでとてもキーが高くてなにより\n 歌詞が深くてとても夜リピートしてます\n \n \n \n \n \n とってもアイシャドウかわいい〜\n ナチュラルメイク編のメイク道具は\n #rikotalk 💌で送ろうと思っています😖\n \n 好きなものを見に纏ってる時が本当に\n 女の子に生まれてよかったーって思えます😌\n 自分に合うカワイイを探すのは大変だな〜😖\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHETDS4T25CW0N27E8HTHWC5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n じゃ、またね。             "}],"source":"archive"}